#~ "possible to use links to files, only links that point to folders will "
#~ "work."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Para engadir un cartafol de correo mbox completo, empregue "
#~ "<userinput><command>ln</command> <option>-s</option> <filename>/algures/"
#~ "Mail/.remotedir.directory</filename> <filename class=\"symlink\">/home/"
